  - Asserts: `GET /api/stats/players` and `GET /api/stats/players?search=...` exclude banned profiles and restore them when unbanned.
  - Command: `cargo test -p jackioh-server --test server -- r3911000`
- Catalog, patches and spec ruling verification:
  - Commands: `cargo jackioh catalog check`, `cargo jackioh patches check`, `cargo jackioh spec check`
- Format and lints:
  - Commands: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -p jackioh-server --all-targets -- -D warnings`

## 5. Done when

- [x] `spec/rulings/R3911000.md` created with valid front matter and proving tests listed.
- [x] `spec/pending/3911.md` created with the R3911000 §11 paragraph.
- [x] `spec/09-architecture.md` links `[[R3911000]]` in §9.12.
- [x] `crates/server/src/db/pg.rs` filters `and p.status <> 'banned'`.
- [x] `crates/server/src/db/fake.rs` skips profiles where `p.status == ProfileStatus::Banned`.
- [x] Contract test `r3911000_list_public_excludes_banned_profile_and_restores_on_unban` passes on memory and postgres.
- [x] API test `r3911000_get_api_stats_players_excludes_banned_profile_and_restores_when_unbanned` passes.
